proton-autogen (2.8.2) noble; urgency=medium

  * New
    - Added Toast message (FR/EN/ZH/ES)
    - Added Sensors menu (stable).
    - Added advanced diagnostics for Debian, Ubuntu, Linux Mint, Arch Linux and CachyOS.
    - Added Lutris export.
    - Added UX error handler.
    - Fixed MangoHud working directory handling for 32-bit applications.

  * UX
    - Added profile badges (DX11, DX12, Win95, Install, etc.).
    - Added platform and game badges (Steam, Battle.net, Favorites, Playtime, etc.).
    - Added live badge updates after editing games.
    - Improved GameList layout and GTK4 interface.

  * Statistics
    - Improved playtime tracking and dashboard statistics.

  * Runtime
    - Improved Proton launch stability.
    - Improved session tracking and error handling.

  * Backend
    - Improved configuration handling.
    - Improved prefix management.
    - Improved Proton detection and selection.

  * Game management
    - Improved game scanning performance.
    - Added game registry.
    - Improved Windows executable detection.

  * Bug fixes
    - Fixed launch return code handling.
    - Fixed badge refresh issues.
    - Fixed GameList update inconsistencies.

  * Developer
    - Improved backend/UI separation.
    - Improved debugging tools and internal APIs.

